# Reference Docs

Task-specific reference documents. **Load on demand only** — do not include these in your context unless actively working on the relevant topic.

## Available References

| Document | Load When |
|----------|-----------|
| `testing-strategy.md` | Writing or modifying tests |
| `api-conventions.md` | Building or modifying API contracts |
| `security-guidelines.md` | Working on auth, data models, API endpoints, or dependencies |
| `ui-conventions.md` | Building or modifying UI components |
| `worktree-ship-hygiene.md` | Before `aet run` or `aet-ship` |

## Usage

When starting work on a task, check this table and load only the references relevant to your current focus. This protects the context window from unnecessary bloat.
